    given-names: Aditya
repository-code: https://github.com/adityavsb/rag-eval-harness
license: MIT
version: 0.2.1
date-released: 2026-10-30
abstract: >-
  Benchmark harness for retrieval-augmented generation on an authored technical
  corpus. Offline mode reports IR metrics (Hit@K, MRR, bootstrap CIs) with BM25,
  dense embeddings, RRF, and cross-encoder reranking; live mode scores OpenRouter
  generators with JEV (Perplexity Decider via OpenRouter decisions API). Aggregate
  results are versioned in git; full per-query traces remain local.
